OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. Light rain in the north
OL,8,Finitially soon clearing, mist and fog
OL,9,Fforming by dawn. The wind remains
OL,10,Flight. Feeling cool, especially in
OL,11,Frural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cloudy or foggy start for
OL,14,Fmany, the best of the sunshine to the
OL,15,Fsouth and west, while some light rain
OL,16,Fmay linger along the coast. Light
OL,17,Fbreeze throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
