OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure remains dominant. Cloudy with
OL,7,Fpatchy light rain Sunday morning.
OL,8,FDrier and sunnier Monday, once fog
OL,9,Fclears. Rain moving in from the south
OL,10,FTuesday. Light winds, breezier on
OL,11,FTuesday.
